OL,3,AMoments of silence mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FA memorial ceremony is under way at the
OL,8,Fsite of New York's World Trade Center
OL,9,Fas the US marks the 25th anniversary of
OL,10,Fthe 9/11 attacks
OL,12,FRelatives of the victims are reading
OL,13,Fout the names of those killed as the
OL,14,Fcrowd observes seven moments of silence
OL,15,F- six marking the times the planes
OL,16,Fcrashed and buildings fell, and one to
OL,17,Fhonour those who have since died from
OL,18,F9/11-related illnesses
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
