OL,3,AMoments of silence mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump is at a separate
OL,8,Fremembrance ceremony in honour of the
OL,9,F184 people killed at the Pentagon when
OL,10,FAmerican Airlines Flight 77 crashed
OL,11,Finto the building
OL,13,FThe morning of the attacks, a fourth
OL,14,Fplane crashed in a field in
OL,15,FPennsylvania after passengers fought
OL,16,Fback against the hijackers
